<title>USA: Production stake held by investors.</title>
<headline>Production stake held by investors.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wisconsin investors Michael Roth and Brian Stark said Monday they hold a 5.31 percent stake in Production Operators Corp or 542,300 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the investors said they bought the stake between February 28 and March 27 at prices ranging from $48 to $56.625 per share.</p>
<p>Production Operators, based in Houston, specializes in oil and gas production services for maximizing the economic recovery of oil and natural gas.</p>
